{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useHotkeyHint(hotkey, options?): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/react-hotkeys/src/useHotkeyHint.ts#L12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useHotkeyHint.ts:12"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a boolean indicating whether held modifiers reveal this shortcut.\nOnly visibility changes from held-key updates cause a rerender.\nUses the nonempty-subset/AltGr rules of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"matchesHeldModifiers"},{"type":"text","value":"; "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"exact"},{"type":"text","value":" requires\nevery modifier. Combine with the action's enabled state before showing a badge.\nThis helper does not register a shortcut or check whether its target is focused."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hotkey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RegisterableHotkey"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HeldModifierOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"hotkey","text":"hotkey","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useHotkeyHint(hotkey, options?): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useHotkeyHint.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/react-hotkeys/src/useHotkeyHint.ts#L12)\n\nReturns a boolean indicating whether held modifiers reveal this shortcut.\nOnly visibility changes from held-key updates cause a rerender.\nUses the nonempty-subset/AltGr rules of `matchesHeldModifiers`; `exact` requires\nevery modifier. Combine with the action's enabled state before showing a badge.\nThis helper does not register a shortcut or check whether its target is focused.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\n### options?\n\n`HeldModifierOptions` = `{}`\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useHotkeyHint\ntitle: useHotkeyHint\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useHotkeyHint(hotkey, options?): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useHotkeyHint.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/react-hotkeys/src/useHotkeyHint.ts#L12)\n\nReturns a boolean indicating whether held modifiers reveal this shortcut.\nOnly visibility changes from held-key updates cause a rerender.\nUses the nonempty-subset/AltGr rules of `matchesHeldModifiers`; `exact` requires\nevery modifier. Combine with the action's enabled state before showing a badge.\nThis helper does not register a shortcut or check whether its target is focused.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\n### options?\n\n`HeldModifierOptions` = `{}`\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n"}
